dialect protocol
protocol flow.spr
version 1
schema flow.mutation
start record
framing record
record flow.flow-add-node tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record flow.flow-wire-edge tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record flow.flow-patch-layout tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
